Copyright: pypdfium2 contributors, including geisserml; generated bindings also
credit ctypesgen developers. Code is available under Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause.
Upstream documentation may be covered by CC-BY-4.0.

Its binary wheels include PDFium and components with additional notices. The
installed wheel carries Apache-2.0.txt, BSD-3-Clause.txt, CC-BY-4.0.txt,
LicenseRef-PdfiumThirdParty.txt, and dep5-wheel in
pypdfium2-4.30.0.dist-info/ under the environment's site-packages directory.
